From 7aebff2ed61d418f8894321f694b4b713654e772 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:09:06 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: add opt-in shared runtime alongside legacy FH

Split the shared host from FS game images and gate launch by exact runtime,
profile ABI and shader chain. Preserve existing FH builds and the signed
payload intake flow. Reset runtime and game state separately on return.

Front-ends: FS manifests require the matching shared runtime descriptor.
Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Opt-in shared runtime for the fork shell while retaining legacy FH builds.
Issue: none (maintainer-requested shared runtime experiment)
